{"schema_version":2,"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","events":[{"id":"chengguo-e-o213","title":"温恢为扬州刺史济为别驾","accounts":[{"id":"chengguo-a-c4d99d7c0941c0722c5f","label":"正文","text":"温恢为扬州刺史济为别驾","evidence":["chengguo-q-ee3917cc7f22f638be28"]}],"participants":[{"person":"chengguo-p0023","role":"扬州刺史","evidence":["chengguo-q-ee3917cc7f22f638be28"]},{"person":"shaodi-p0009","role":"别驾","evidence":["chengguo-q-ee3917cc7f22f638be28"]},{"person":"cao-cao","role":"令曰季子为臣吴宜有君、今君还州吾无忧矣","evidence":["chengguo-q-ee3917cc7f22f638be28"]}],"place":null,"time":{"label":"原文纪年见引文；不换算公元年","precision":"undated","basis":"本批仅记录原文时间表达，不由相邻纪年推算公元年。","evidence":["chengguo-q-ee3917cc7f22f638be28"]},"ordering_evidence":"chengguo-q-ee3917cc7f22f638be28","source_order":[14,369,6],"order":3139},{"id":"liusima-e-o122","title":"温恢一朝尽散家财赈施宗族，州里比之郇越","accounts":[{"id":"liusima-a-2e1e68b740f1a9da25ad","label":"正文","text":"温恢一朝尽散家财赈施宗族，州里比之郇越","evidence":["liusima-q-6a9eb3b6c03d531dcd9b"]}],"participants":[{"person":"chengguo-p0023","role":"内足于财，以为世方乱安以富为，一朝尽散，赈施宗族，州里高之，比之郇越","evidence":["liusima-q-6a9eb3b6c03d531dcd9b"]}],"place":null,"time":{"label":"年代未详","precision":"undated","basis":"本批仅记录原文时间表达，不由相邻纪年推算公元年。","evidence":["liusima-q-6a9eb3b6c03d531dcd9b"]},"ordering_evidence":"liusima-q-6a9eb3b6c03d531dcd9b","source_order":[15,204,38],"order":3335},{"id":"liusima-e-o126","title":"太祖以温恢出为扬州刺史，遣蒋济还州佐之","accounts":[{"id":"liusima-a-25dbdcb2e8aa01ac39a9","label":"正文","text":"太祖以温恢出为扬州刺史，遣蒋济还州佐之","evidence":["liusima-q-22fa782cfbf504c9dfba"]},{"id":"liusima-a-41be45e0b6f309674bc3","label":"正文","text":"太祖语张辽、乐进等：扬州刺史晓达军事，动静与共咨议","evidence":["liusima-q-350bc172c319b34af315"]}],"participants":[{"person":"cao-cao","role":"以恢出为扬州刺史，称甚欲使卿在亲近、顾以为不如此州事大，欲得蒋济为治中，乃遣济还州；语张辽、乐进等，扬州刺史晓达军事，动静与共咨议","evidence":["liusima-q-22fa782cfbf504c9dfba","liusima-q-350bc172c319b34af315"]},{"person":"chengguo-p0023","role":"出为扬州刺史；被嘱诸将与其动静共咨议","evidence":["liusima-q-22fa782cfbf50